@startuml
title PolicyPal - Complete Sequence Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor User

participant "PolicyPal UI" as UI
participant "Policy API" as PolicyAPI
participant "Chat API" as ChatAPI
participant "Policy Manager" as Policy
participant "Document Parser" as Parser
participant "Retrieval Engine" as Retrieval
participant "Claude API" as Claude

== Upload Policy ==

User -> UI : Select PDF / DOCX
UI -> PolicyAPI : Upload policy

PolicyAPI -> Parser : Extract text

alt Invalid / unreadable file

    Parser --> PolicyAPI : Error
    PolicyAPI --> UI : Upload failed
    UI --> User : Show error

else Valid policy

    Parser --> PolicyAPI : Extracted text
    PolicyAPI -> Policy : Set uploaded policy
    Policy --> PolicyAPI : Policy active
    PolicyAPI --> UI : Upload successful
    UI --> User : Show active policy

end


== Ask Policy Question ==

User -> UI : Ask question
UI -> ChatAPI : Send question

ChatAPI -> Policy : Get active policy
Policy --> ChatAPI : Default or uploaded policy

ChatAPI -> Retrieval : Find relevant sections
Retrieval --> ChatAPI : Relevant policy content

alt Sensitive / unsupported question

    ChatAPI --> UI : Escalation response
    UI --> User : Refer to People & Culture

else Relevant policy found

    ChatAPI -> Claude : Question + policy context
    Claude --> ChatAPI : Grounded answer

    ChatAPI --> UI : Answer + citation
    UI --> User : Display answer

end


== Reset to Default Policy ==

User -> UI : Click "Use Default Policy"
UI -> PolicyAPI : Reset policy

PolicyAPI -> Policy : Clear uploaded policy
Policy --> PolicyAPI : Default handbook active

PolicyAPI --> UI : Reset successful
UI --> User : Show default policy

@enduml